  "plumbing": {
    "_doc": "Package Q1 (tools/qa: refcut, cuts, normalize, health, sbs). Values calibrated on ../ref/rover_doom.webm frames 0-539 unless marked 'uncalibrated'. Analysis size is the frame scaled to analysis_size; d = mean absolute luma difference (0-255) between consecutive frames at that size. Fixer pass: cuts rule B (cut_hist_mean, cut_hist_peak_ratio), dissolve_* and swap_peak_ratio, and health glitch_min_tiles, glitch_min_area_px, glitch2_min_area_px were calibrated on ALL 34444 frames of the reference (reference maxima: 3 coarse tiles, 875 px fine, 9275 px two-frame). stills_tile_px / stills_max_tile_diff come from ENGINE-SPEC and are uncalibrated on real still renders.",
    "format": {
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "fps": 24,
      "fps_tolerance": 0.001,
      "first_pts_tolerance_s": 0.0005
    },
    "analysis_size": [
      320,
      180
    ],
    "refcut": {
