      "_doc": "Strict gate (max_faint_frac_strict, max_fringe_run_px_strict) is the default. The loose max_faint_frac applies only to pieces whose sha256 is in legacy_list (approved before the tool existed; they measure faint 0.08-0.28, fringe runs up to 351 px). Calibrated 2026-11-20: approved pieces and fresh cuts have key_blob 0 px, lost_blob 0 px, faded 0.0, translucent_interior <= 0.0031; fresh cuts have fringe_run 0 px. Mutants: 20x10 key slab = 200 px blob, 1 px purple bottom line = run 137 px, 50x50 hole = lost_blob 2500 px, alpha x0.55 = faded 1.0."
